{"id":"5902e6e7f68157da","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Reflective Subcategory","display":"df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory — ZFC Cat2 Reflective Subcategory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory — ZFC Cat2 Reflective Subcategory","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory]]","[[58-df-adjoint-functors]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory — ZFC Cat2 Reflective Subcategory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35170dc430c7d67b\" href=\"?note=35170dc430c7d67b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory\">58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dfa5042443233c40\" href=\"?note=dfa5042443233c40\" title=\"58-df-adjoint-functors\">58-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,I,L,O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,I,L,O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\)</span> (subcategory, ambient category, inclusion, reflector, and subcategory datum)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S\\)</span> (full-subcategory predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35170dc430c7d67b\" href=\"?note=35170dc430c7d67b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory\">58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\\)</span> (adjoint-functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dfa5042443233c40\" href=\"?note=dfa5042443233c40\" title=\"58-df-adjoint-functors\">58-df-adjoint-functors</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2ReflectiveSubcategory}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2ReflectiveSubcategory}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}reflective\\text{-}subcategory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2ReflectiveSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,I,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(L,I,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\exists O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal D=(O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D)\\land\\forall x\\in O_D\\cup M_D\\;(I(x)=x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}reflective\\text{-}subcategory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2ReflectiveSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,I,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(L,I,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\exists O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal D=(O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D)\\land\\forall x\\in O_D\\cup M_D\\;(I(x)=x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(I:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> is the inclusion right adjoint and is explicitly the identity on both the object and morphism carriers of the full subcategory datum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"35170dc430c7d67b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"35170dc430c7d67b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S$ (full-subcategory predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S$ (adjoint-functor predicate, see [[58-df-adjoint-functors]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,I,L,O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2ReflectiveSubcategory}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}reflective\\text{-}subcategory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2ReflectiveSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,I,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(L,I,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\exists O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal D=(O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D)\\land\\forall x\\in O_D\\cup M_D\\;(I(x)=x)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"I:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1587","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-reflective-subcategory]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","35170dc430c7d67b","dfa5042443233c40"]}